			"notes": "Improved just about everything about the **BaseRaider** (formerly called StashFinder) module\n* The module is now way less buggy\n* More configuration options for the user (such as selecting the items you want to find)\n* It uses a better roaming algorithm (it previously just used Baritone's roam feature, now it tries to follow chunk trails)\n* Instead of checking every chest it finds, it now does a basic check to determine which chunks are worth searching\nHowever, there are still many things to add to improve both the BaseRaider module and the addon itself."
